		(property "Description" "Recom Power 5V 1A DC/DC Converter  The Recom R-78E5.0-X.X is a compact DC/DC converter module that is a pin for pin drop-in replacement for the LM7805 linear voltage regulator.\n\nSpecifications:\n\n• Input Range: 7-28V\n• Output Voltage: 5V\n• Output Current: 1A\n• Max Efficiency: 91%\n\nhttps://www.recom-power.com/pdf/Innoline/R-78Exx-1.0.pdf Datasheet"
			(at 0 0 0)
